reak"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いよいよ明日から"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーライブ サードシーズンです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は私たちもそして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お客さんも体力勝負です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かなり熱いライブになりそうです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"タオルやTシャツの着替え"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"水分補給など、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"季節の変わり目なので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"体調に気をつけてください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私たちも全8公演20人全員で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"走り抜けられるよう頑張ります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/04/13/0654893/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"か  り  ん  (っｴ`o)"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-11309":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼おかえりなさいませっきゃぴっ／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/03/9847284/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/03/9847284/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/03/9847284/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/03/9847284/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなこの写真を待ってただろうな\nはははは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":".........\n緊急決定！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"下北ＦＭ「DJ Tomoaki's Radio Show!」\n◆放送局：下北ＦＭ 88.8MHz\n◆日時：2013年4月4日(木)19:00～ ＜公開生放送＞\n◆メインMC：大蔵ともあき（下北ＦＭ）\n◆アシスタントMC：伊藤万理華、川村真洋（乃木坂46）\n◆場所：東京・下北沢駅南口\n「SFMホール(スタジオベイド下北沢店)」より公開生放送\n※チケット料金1500円（別途ドリンク代￥500）\n当日16時00分より会場にて先着100名様限定で販売いたします\n詳細はコチラ：http://www.shimokitafm.com/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日、真洋と私がアシスタントMCを\n務めさせていただくことに\nなりました。\nぜひ来てください♪\n見てください♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/03/9847284/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"月刊エンタメのドルヲタかなりん\nひなぴょんのコメント見た？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/03/9847284/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見た～♪2人ともいつもからかうし、\nほめてくれないから余計嬉しかった笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/03/9847284/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもどんな姿で家で\n過ごしてますか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/03/9847284/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スウェット！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/03/9847284/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エイプリルフールは\n何個の嘘にひっかかった？←"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/03/9847284/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"残念ながら嘘つかれてもないし、\n騙されもしなかったんだよね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/03/9847284/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というかそれどころじゃなかったよねw"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/03/9847284/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生まれ変われるとしたら、\n何になりたい？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/03/9847284/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女の子かな。\nでも男の子にもなってみたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/03/9847284/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかに妹いたら\nどんな姉になりそうですか？（笑）"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/03/9847284/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心配性でおせっかいして\nウザがられそう笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/03/9847284/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"トマトを好きになったきっかけは？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/03/9847284/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生のトマトが食べられなかった\nんだけどね、ある時\n砂糖をかけたら美味しいことを\n知って、はまっちゃったの。\nそしたらなくても自然と\n食べられるようになってた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/03/9847284/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美容とか健康も気にしてたら余計に。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/03/9847284/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんて呼ばれるのが\n一番気に入ってますか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/03/9847284/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正式なあだ名がまりっかだから\n迷ったらまりっかって呼んでね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/03/9847284/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっか気に入ってるよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/03/9847284/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遠くてわからなかったから聞きたい\n書道でなにやった?＼(^-^)／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/03/9847284/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"桜の花びらを散らせたよ。\nあと、生駒のフォローもしました！\n**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"春の嵐がやってきた。\n私は家にこもってました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は晴れるみたいで安心安心"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/03/9847284/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「あの日見た花の名前を僕達はまだ知らない。」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"劇場版が早く観たすぎて\nうずうずうずうずしておる。\n予告で泣きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼べっ別にすきでハート作ったわけじゃないんだからねっ／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/03/9847284/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ツンデレ。\n1枚目とキャラ違いすぎてはははは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日楽しみだっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/03/9847284/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張ろう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-21588":{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/11/07/7065928/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーライブ初日の写メ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうすぐ一ヶ月か............はやいなあ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次回の乃木ののに\n登場します！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あすかりん まあや ひめたん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/11/07/7065928/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一年前の画像(゜ω゜)ごめんぬ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから、いま乃木のので\nふたりトークのペアを募集してるよ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか喋ってほしいふたりが\n思い付いたら\n乃木ののさんにメールしてね☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねえねえ\nきゅんきゅん王国のみなさんは\nひめたんと誰のぺあが好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"格差社会コンビ(あすかりん)\nなかいさん(まりか)\nそんバカコンビ(川後さん)とか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らりんお姉さんとの姉妹とか\nかなりんとのぺろぺろとか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会とかでファンのみなさんに\nよく言われるのは\nさゆひめ、まなひめ、とかかなあ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしておとといは\nKiyora EGG Bar Standの\nイベントに参加してきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日から渋谷PARCOスペイン坂広場に\n登場するそうなのでぜひ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美味しかったです(＊´ω`＊)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/11/07/7065928/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きよらユニフォームかわいい♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、そうそう\nこの前の2部のヘアが\n絶対伝わってないと思って(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/11/07/7065928/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実はこれ握手会終わって撮ったから\n若干崩れてるんだけど\nまとめるやつ。これです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これをやるとお姉さんに見えるそう\nメンバーから結構好評だったよ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと日記でいい損ねたけど\n2部は白のモコモコカーディガンを着て\n握手したよ( ^o^ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっと代わり映えしたほうが\nいいなかと思って着たらみんなに\n「寒くなった？」って聞かれた♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"有明コロシアムは\n3dayじゃなくて3daysだよね～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"タイトルも間違えてたみたいで\nほんとにごめんね～( >_< )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めーるもなんか\nまったくおんなじことを\nふつか連続で報告したりとかして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私どうしたの疲れてる？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/11/07/7065928/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/11/07/7065928/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年ももう終わりに近づいていますが、\n何かひめたんやり残したことはない？\nあ！サンリオピューロランド！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/11/07/7065928/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よく握手会の時に言ってる\nひめたんTシャツってなに？\nそうだね、説明不足でごめんなさい。\nオフィシャルTシャツや\nB.L.TさんとのコラボTシャツとして\nメンバーがデザインしたことがあったの＊\nそれで、ひめたんがデザインしたやつを\nひめたんTシャツって呼んでます( ^o^ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/11/07/7065928/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島では乃木坂ちゃんに合えないので。。\nぜひ応援メッセージいただけませんか？？\nいつか広島でライブしたい！\n今は広島の人たちには遠征してもらうか\nPCの中で会うのがほとんどかもだけど\n直接みなさんに「ただいま」言いたい❁"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/11/07/7065928/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは女の子の髪型何が好きー？\nまあツインは好きなんだけど\n編み込みまきまきとか。\nお人形さんみたいだよね＊＊\nそういえば時々聞かれるんだけど\nクールなおにゃのこや\nナチュラルなおにゃのこも\nもちろん好きだよ(＊＾ω＾＊)らぶ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/11/07/7065928/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんはコンビニスイーツで\n何か好きなものはありますか？\nなんだろう～コンビニスイーツ\nコンビニは季節ものに敏感だよね♪\nドライフルーツもよく買うよ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/11/07/7065928/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スペシャル個別握手会\nひめたんに会う 話す 笑う\nそれだけで特別なんだからね～\nわあ( ´•̥ω•̥` )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/11/07/7065928/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんの日記の\nコメント欄下２ケタに46を踏んだ方へ\n手書きでコメ返するコーナー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼ ひめたん46 ／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/11/07/7065928/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもたくさんのコメント\nありがとうございます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近コメントいっぱい\\( ˆoˆ )/\nなんでだろー？\nみんなひめたんのこと最近気になる？♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"500まであと少し！\n年内には達成できそうやんな～\nめーる1000件もな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"企画たくさん考えてくれてありがとう\nじっくり検討します\\❁﻿/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(＊´・ω・＊)"}],"source":"archive"}}